2. Retry Logic with Exponential Backoff: Robust error handling for oracle price fetches:

```TypeScript
for (let i = 0; i < maxRetries; i++) {
  try {
    const priceData = await fetchPythPrice(feedId);
    if (priceData) return formatPythPrice(priceData);
  } catch (error) {
    await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, 1000 * (i + 1)));
  }
}
```

3. Continuous Monitoring with Cron: Event creation every hour, resolution checks every 5 minutes:

```TypeScript
cron.schedule(cronSchedule, async () => {
  await createPredictionEvent();
});
startResolutionMonitor(config.eventResolutionInterval);
```

4. Daily Rate Limiting: Prevents spam with in-memory counter reset:

```TypeScript
